# xremap (Emacs-key mirroring into the browser) creates its output device
# through uinput. Stock Omarchy ships no rule for it: /dev/uinput stays
# root-only 0600 and xremap exits with
#   "Error: Failed to prepare an output device — Permission denied".
# Group+mode rather than TAG+="uaccess": deterministic, no logind timing.
KERNEL=="uinput", MODE="0660", GROUP="input"
